<h1 data-copy-en="Portia" data-copy-zh="Portia">Portia</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Plan Portia’s three conversations, car and outfit requirements, villa access and optional dates." data-copy-zh="安排Portia的3次谈心，核对跑车、服装、别墅入口与可选约会。">Plan Portia’s three conversations, car and outfit requirements, villa access and optional dates.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Night_Club_accepted_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_accepted_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_and_Night_Club_Invite_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main_menu_branches_and_experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Villa_Branch_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Learn_Investment_Savvy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Optional_Mall_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Villa_with_Portia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Mall_Shopping_Date_with_Portia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sports_Car_Ride_with_Portia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Reply_reference"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dating_Standards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Portia — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/portia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Portia — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/portia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Portia — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Portia’s route begins with a Sports Car and continues through three ordered conversations, a villa visit and optional dates. Plan around her changing locations and the two large route expenses.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_and_When_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>City Street (Downtown): daily 10:00–14:00. Shopping Mall (Interior): even game days 14:00–18:00. Night Club: days divisible by 3, 21:00–24:00, continuing 00:00–02:00 the following day.</p><p>Her villa visit is a remote option from Apartment Complex, daily 19:00–23:00, after its own relationship and conversation requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="High-affection_villa_routes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Route_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Start_Her_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Buy Sports Car at Sports Car Dealer, 09:00–18:00, $250,000 and 30 minutes. Carry it for the initial Compliment Portia. Talk opens at Acknowledged (10); jewelry and flirting open at Known (25), with Charm 50 for flirting. Flirting is on the street or at the club, not the mall.</p><p>Complete the conversations in order: Sports Car Ride with Portia at Known (25), from the street → Mall Shopping Date with Portia at Friend (100), from the even-day mall portrait, with Dating Outfit level 3+ and $50,000 → Villa with Portia at 300 affection, from her club portrait, with $300,000. The menu calls the third action Villa with Portia.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Sports Car Ride with Portia</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Street (Downtown); Known (25); content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">45 min; 20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mall Shopping Date with Portia</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Shopping Mall (Interior); Friend (100); Dating Outfit level 3+; after Sports Car Ride with Portia</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; $50,000; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Villa with Portia</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Night Club; affection 300; after Mall Shopping Date with Portia</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $300,000; 40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At 600 affection and after the third conversation, use Visit Portia at the Villa from the Apartment Complex, 19:00–23:00. The opening cost is 180 minutes and 40 Energy. Her starting conversation offers a separate Investment Savvy teaching reply while that skill is unlearned; choosing the Commerce portfolio topic is a different branch.</p><p>The car, mall outing and setup together cost $600,000 before gifts. The car-ride conversation has no additional cash fee.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Villa_Visit_Entry_and_Investment_Savvy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Interaction.2C_Gifts_and_Dating_Standards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Interaction,_Gifts_and_Dating_Standards"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Compliment Portia</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Street (Downtown) / Shopping Mall (Interior) / Night Club; Stranger (0); first introduction: own Sports Car</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Portia</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Street (Downtown) / Shopping Mall (Interior) / Night Club; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Flirt with Portia</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Street (Downtown) / Night Club; Known (25); Charm 50</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+3 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dating Standards</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Street (Downtown); Known (25); Communication 60</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Commerce +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Street (Downtown) / Shopping Mall (Interior) / Night Club; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min; 1 Jewelry</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+7 base affection; 6/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Street (Downtown) / Shopping Mall (Interior) / Night Club; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+3 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Shopping Mall (Interior); Close Friend (200); even days; after Restoring the Boardwalk; 17:00–17:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; $50; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Shopping Mall (Interior); Friend (100); City Street 12:00–13:59; mall on even days 14:00–17:59; 12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 1 Voucher</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Expensive Drink</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Night Club; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; $500</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Visit Portia at the Villa</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Apartment Complex; affection 600; after Villa with Portia; 19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; 40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">affection follows the conversation choices</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Dating Standards: Known (25), Communication 60, 30 minutes, +1 Commerce and 8 direct affection, once. The other table lists actual base affection from gifts and ordinary interactions.</p><p>Her mall Boardwalk Sunset Date can actually start only on even days 17:00–18:00, because she leaves at 18:00. The Voucher prize date is reachable on the street 12:00–14:00 or at the even-day mall 14:00–18:00. The two dates are separate, once-only outings.</p><p>Shared Invite Date invitations at KTV/Night Club need Crush (400) and the completed third conversation, 20:00–23:00. KTV: 120 minutes/$150/40 Energy; Night Club: 120 minutes/$100/30 Energy and its supporter-content lock. Each venue has a shared daily invitation allowance.</p><p>In Kupie's Love Training, her ordinary requirement is Friend (100), Jessie at minigame level 5 and the indicated selection access. Her training affection, Hearts and Charms are separate from ordinary Portia affection.</p><p>Relationship bonuses improve at Attractiveness35, $500,000 current Wealth and Dating Outfit level4+. Learning Investment Savvy improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>For the first compliment, carry the actual Sports Car key item; cash alone does not count as ownership.</li><li>Shopping Trip requires the completed car conversation and Dating Outfit level 3+, as well as the even-day mall portrait and full $50,000.</li><li>The club setup uses 300 affection; the later remote villa visit uses 600. The third conversation’s completed state is required for both the villa visit and venue invitations.</li><li>If the skill-teaching reply is gone, check whether Investment Savvy is already learned.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="items.html">Sports Car, outfits and gifts</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Dates, villa visits and venue invitations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">Investment Savvy and investments</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie’s Love Training</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Travel and venue access</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Night_Club_accepted_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_accepted_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_and_Night_Club_Invite_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main_menu_branches_and_experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Villa_Branch_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Learn_Investment_Savvy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Optional_Mall_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Villa_with_Portia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Mall_Shopping_Date_with_Portia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sports_Car_Ride_with_Portia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reply_reference"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dating_Standards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Portia 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/portia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Portia 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/portia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Portia 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Portia的路线从跑车开始，接着有3次依序完成的谈心、别墅来访和可选约会。需要同时安排她的排班，以及两笔较大的路线支出。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_and_When_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>城市街道（市中心）：每天10:00–14:00。购物中心（内部）：双数日14:00–18:00。夜店：日期可被3整除的当天21:00–24:00，延续至次日00:00–02:00。</p><p>别墅来访从公寓楼的远程选项发起，每天19:00–23:00，另需达到对应好感并完成前置谈心。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-High-affection_villa_routes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Route_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Start_Her_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先在跑车经销商09:00–18:00购买跑车，消耗$250,000和30分钟。首次使用赞美Portia时需持有跑车。已遇见（10好感）开放交谈，已知（25好感）开放珠宝与调情；调情还需魅力50，仅在街道或夜店，商场没有该选项。</p><p>3次谈心依次为：街道上已知（25好感）的和 Portia 坐跑车兜风 → 双数日商场中朋友（100好感）的和 Portia 的商场购物约会，另需约会装3级以上及$50,000 → 夜店中300好感的与 Portia 共处别墅，需$300,000。第3次谈心对应菜单行动与 Portia 共处别墅。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Portia 坐跑车兜风（菜单：跑车兜风）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市街道（市中心）；已知（25好感）；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">45分钟；20精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Portia 的商场购物约会（菜单：购物之旅）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">购物中心（内部）；朋友（100好感）；约会装3级以上；完成：和 Portia 坐跑车兜风</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；$50,000；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Portia 共处别墅（菜单：安排顶层公寓）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">夜店；好感300；完成：和 Portia 的商场购物约会</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$300,000；40精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>完成第3次谈心、达到600好感后，在公寓大楼19:00–23:00选择去别墅拜访Portia，开始时消耗180分钟和40精力。尚未学会投资眼光时，开场有独立的教学答复；商业投资组合话题是另一条分支。</p><p>跑车、商场出游与住所安排合计$600,000，不含普通礼物；跑车谈心本身不再收现金。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Villa_Visit_Entry_and_Investment_Savvy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Interaction.2C_Gifts_and_Dating_Standards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Interaction,_Gifts_and_Dating_Standards"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">赞美Portia</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市街道（市中心） / 购物中心（内部） / 夜店；陌生人（0好感）；首次接触需持有跑车</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Portia交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市街道（市中心） / 购物中心（内部） / 夜店；已遇见（10好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Portia调情</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市街道（市中心） / 夜店；已知（25好感）；魅力50</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+3；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">约会标准</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市街道（市中心）；已知（25好感）；沟通60</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；商业+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市街道（市中心） / 购物中心（内部） / 夜店；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟；珠宝×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+7；每天6次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市街道（市中心） / 购物中心（内部） / 夜店；相识（50好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟；鲜花×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+3；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨栈道日落约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">购物中心（内部）；亲密朋友（200好感）；双数日；完成：重修海滨木栈道；17:00–17:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；$50；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">购物中心（内部）；朋友（100好感）；城市街道12:00–13:59；双数日商场14:00–17:59；12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">昂贵饮品</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">夜店；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；$500</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">去别墅拜访Portia</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">公寓楼；好感600；完成：与 Portia 共处别墅；19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；40精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">好感按对话选择结算</td></tr></tbody></table><p>约会标准需已知（25好感）与沟通60，消耗30分钟，一次性获得商业+1及8直接好感。其他普通行动与礼物的实际基础好感见表。</p><p>商场里的海滨栈道日落约会实际只可在双数日17:00–18:00开始，因为她18:00离开。兑换券约会可从街道12:00–14:00，或双数日商场14:00–18:00发起；两次约会分别完成，各仅一次。</p><p>KTV／夜店的共同邀请约会需迷恋（400好感）并完成第3次谈心，时间为20:00–23:00。KTV消耗120分钟、$150、40精力；夜店消耗120分钟、$100、30精力，并检查其支持者内容权限。各场所共用当天邀请额度。</p><p>Kupie 的爱之训练中的普通解锁条件为朋友（100好感）、Jessie的小游戏等级达到5，以及所示选择权限。训练好感、爱心与护符和Portia的普通好感分开计算。</p><p>吸引力35、当前财富$500,000及约会装4级以上分别可提高关系加成；学会投资眼光也有加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>首次称赞需持有实际跑车关键道具，仅有足够金钱不算拥有。</li><li>商场谈心还需完成跑车谈心、约会装3级以上、双数日商场排班，以及完整的$50,000。</li><li>夜店住所安排需300好感，之后的远程别墅来访需600；别墅来访与场所邀请都需第3次谈心已完成。</li><li>技能教学答复不见时，先确认是否已学会投资眼光。</li></ul></section>
